65
00:06:48,500 --> 00:06:58,500
Yes. It's been a nightmare from the start. Could your group head west and reinforce our defenses? The added support would be a big help.

66
00:06:58,500 --> 00:07:01,500
We don't have to convince us. That's the whole reason we're here.

67
