83
00:08:54,500 --> 00:09:05,500
Really? Well done. They'll be a good addition to the reinforcement team. The battlefield is the best place to grow stronger, as long as you don't end up dead.

84
00:09:06,500 --> 00:09:16,500
Okay. It's time we join this fight. Pretty sure I know where to find the vampire commander. This might be over fast if we take the leader's head.

85
00:09:16,500 --> 00:09:24,500
