89
00:09:49,500 --> 00:09:53,500
You're going to drink his blood, aren't you, Mika? Go ahead.

90
00:09:56,500 --> 00:10:02,500
You should take advantage of being on the battlefield, since it's forbidden to drink directly from a human back home.

91
00:10:02,500 --> 00:10:08,500
Ha! And why should I follow those rules? They didn't stop you from drinking my blood. You didn't hesitate.

92
00:10:09,500 --> 00:10:16,500
Ha! Don't say such things or you'll hurt my reputation. Besides, it was you who came and offered me your blood that night.

93
00:10:17,500 --> 00:10:22,500
Though, it was so you could steal a gun and map from my mansion. How did that work out for you?

94
00:10:22,500 --> 00:10:28,500
I had no idea that I was playing into your hands, or that my family would be killed to amuse you.

95
00:10:29,500 --> 00:10:30,500
Hmph.

96
00:10:30,500 --> 00:10:33,500
How many humans have been slaughtered just because you got a little bored?

97
00:10:33,500 --> 00:10:40,500
Oh, Mika, why are you still upset about ancient history? What's it matter? You're a vampire yourself now.

98
00:10:40,500 --> 00:10:54,500
I'm not upset. At least not at you. I'm angry with myself because I didn't have the power to protect my family.

99
00:10:55,500 --> 00:11:03,500
Hmph. You're a glutton for self-punishment. So, how are you going to protect you? He's the last of your family in this whole wide world.

100
00:11:03,500 --> 00:11:13,500
That's love. It could be eternal. But seriously, Mika, you really need to drink a human's blood soon.

101
00:11:14,500 --> 00:11:19,500
You know what happens to vampires who get too thirsty. I'd hate for that to happen to you.

102
00:11:33,500 --> 00:11:38,500
So, that's what I'm saying. Where have you been toнутm and the advent of mud?

103
00:11:38,500 --> 00:11:45,500
It scales by the way so this land literally into the first place I'd love to go with you.

104
00:11:45,500 --> 00:11:55,500
