Accept that this is your life now, and I promise you, you'll start feeling better.

108
00:12:11,040 --> 00:12:17,620
You'll finally be transformed into a complete vampire with an immortal body and strength far beyond that of a human.

109
00:12:19,820 --> 00:12:24,480
No. No way. I refuse to become a vampire.

110
00:12:26,340 --> 00:12:28,040
You say that now.

111
00:12:28,500 --> 00:12:30,440
But your body must be craving blood.

112
00:12:32,540 --> 00:12:37,440
I bet every muscle you have is in pain, thirsty, and crying out for a sip.

113
00:12:39,440 --> 00:12:42,800
Why do you fight it? Give your body what it desires.

114
00:12:44,440 --> 00:12:45,220
Shut up!

115
00:12:46,540 --> 00:12:48,240
You're going to waste a wane.

116
00:12:48,780 --> 00:12:52,980
I'd rather die as a human than live as a vampire!

117
