I see.

118
00:12:55,140 --> 00:12:59,480
I'll admit immortality isn't as glamorous as one might think.

119
00:13:00,020 --> 00:13:02,640
It can be boring living for thousands of years, never aging.

120
00:13:02,900 --> 00:13:04,080
