122
00:13:08,560 --> 00:13:10,280
Because I've changed you for good.

123
00:13:10,660 --> 00:13:13,220
If you don't drink blood, you'll become a hideous demon.

124
00:13:13,680 --> 00:13:15,640
You'll have no will or mind of your own.

125
00:13:15,820 --> 00:13:18,080
So you have to drink Mika, or else you'll...

126
00:13:18,080 --> 00:13:19,340
There's no way I'll do it.

127
00:13:20,120 --> 00:13:20,540
Never.

128
00:13:21,440 --> 00:13:23,980
I will never become a monster like you!

129
00:13:25,120 --> 00:13:27,700
Well, I'll give you another option then.

130
00:13:27,700 --> 00:13:41,280
Drink your fill of my blight.

131
00:13:41,540 --> 00:13:43,600
It's the only other way that you'll survive.

132
00:13:43,600 --> 00:13:56,540
There's absolutely no reason for you to refuse this.

133
00:13:57,540 --> 00:13:59,640
