134
00:13:59,640 --> 00:14:08,000
Weren't you listening to me?

135
00:14:08,340 --> 00:14:10,020
I won't ever become one of you!

136
00:14:10,020 --> 00:14:10,100
I won't ever become one of you!

137
00:14:10,100 --> 00:14:37,860
