153
00:16:04,020 --> 00:16:05,980
Remember how strong that noble was?

154
00:16:06,940 --> 00:16:09,300
Surely you'd realize that he was way out of our need.

155
00:16:09,680 --> 00:16:13,480
Even with the Black Demon series weapons, he could have slaughtered us in the blink of an eye.

156
00:16:13,480 --> 00:16:16,000
