157
00:16:16,540 --> 00:16:19,520
You will be of no use to the army if you're a bunch of corpses.

158
00:16:20,800 --> 00:16:24,940
Honestly, you'd be as useless as little babies with toys if we were really fighting a noble.

159
00:16:25,380 --> 00:16:26,620
Why is she smiling?

160
00:16:26,800 --> 00:16:28,300
