One thing, though.

180
00:17:14,980 --> 00:17:16,760
Your organs explode when you take three.

181
00:17:18,340 --> 00:17:22,540
Even two pills will severely damage your body and could cause you to die of shock.

182
00:17:22,800 --> 00:17:24,820
To be safe, you should stick to one at first.

183
00:17:25,320 --> 00:17:27,700
Also, the effects only last for 15 minutes.

184
00:17:28,120 --> 00:17:31,080
After the pill wears off, you'll be just as vulnerable as you are now.

185
00:17:31,080 --> 00:17:35,020
Here. A pack for each of you.

186
00:17:38,860 --> 00:17:40,720
Why didn't you give these to us earlier?

187
00:17:41,040 --> 00:17:42,660
We could have used them against that noble.

188
00:17:43,020 --> 00:17:44,580
We could have destroyed that guy.

189
00:17:44,640 --> 00:17:45,840
We still wouldn't have won.

190
00:17:46,560 --> 00:17:49,820
It takes ten seconds before the pill's effects start to take hold.

191
00:17:49,820 --> 00:17:52,120
In those ten seconds, we'd be dead.

192
00:17:52,780 --> 00:17:55,100
He could have killed every single one of us.

193
00:17:55,100 --> 00:18:00,040
One more question.

194
00:18:00,780 --> 00:18:02,460
You mentioned demons earlier.

195
00:18:02,900 --> 00:18:05,420
I definitely want to max out my Black Demon series.

196
00:18:05,420 --> 00:18:10,720
If I take this pill, will I be able to draw out the true power of my cursed gear?

197
00:18:10,720 --> 00:18:17,000
Sorry. The pill is just temporary.

198
00:18:17,860 --> 00:18:22,480
You'll have to study and train more to master the cursed power, but we don't have time for that right now.

199
00:18:23,400 --> 00:18:26,360
Nope. This is war. So for now, you'll take a shortcut.

200
00:18:27,020 --> 00:18:29,500
We need every advantage over the enemy we can get.

201
00:18:33,940 --> 00:18:35,120
You've got a good point.

202
