225
00:20:51,380 --> 00:20:52,960
Hey, can you guys get out?

226
00:20:54,620 --> 00:20:55,780
Yeah, no problem.

227
00:20:56,220 --> 00:20:58,440
Then you guys go ahead and we'll catch up with you.

228
00:20:58,880 --> 00:21:01,160
We've got to find a med team for the corporal.

229
00:21:01,160 --> 00:21:03,080
